      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MORNING DAISY (2) had been racing well with a Grade 5 win three back then placed next time before missing the frame latest at this track. Likely to improve sharply this time. SIMPLY NED (3) showed strong early pace and proved too slick around Ballarat over 390m in 22.09, claiming a Grade 5 by 6 lengths. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. HOLLYWOOD FRANKY (7) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when sixth at Healesville over 350m behind Daintree Dazzler (19.81) in a Special conditions Veteran race. Likely to be thereabouts. IN ACTION (1) is a last start winner and can go on with it.",
